{"id":"u-8c904a50-b911-4108-84d0-79d0bebdcfe5","src":"community","title":"Dodo's Hybrid Athlete Program","author":"Sumit D.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/X9QTHi-dodos-hybrid-athlete-program","desc":"This is a hybrid training program designed to develop three key qualities: general strength, athleticism, and combat readiness. Rather than specializing in a single area, the goal is to build a well-rounded, capable physique that is strong, resilient, explosive, and functional.\n\nThe program combines foundational strength training with movements that improve mobility, endurance, coordination, and overall athletic performance, while also incorporating elements that support combat sports and martial arts training.\n\nThe emphasis is on long-term progression, longevity, and sustainability. It is built not only to enhance performance inside the gym, but also to be improve real-world physical capability and allow for an active life outside of training.\n\nThe objective is simple: be strong enough to lift, athletic enough to move, and conditioned enough to fight—while remaining healthy for years to come.","level":["Advanced"],"goals":["Athletics","Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":6,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-04T20:24:05.954Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Full Body A (Push focused)","Athleticism and Conditioning","Full Body B (Wt. Calisthenics)","Athleticism and Conditioning","Full Body C (Posterior Chain)","Active Recovery Day"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Handstand Push Up","sets":[{"amrap":1,"rpe":8}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Front Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Walking Lunge","sets":[{"amrap":1,"rpe":8}]}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":50,"rpe":10}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":10,"x":3}